Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.30,0:00:03.94,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(262,1123,262,1105,0,450)\fad(350,300)\fnPoppins SemiBold\fs168\fsp-1.0\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&H000000&\3a&H9A&\blur7\shad6\4c&H000000&\4a&H48&}e o seu rim?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O que esse canudinho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.12,0:00:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}tem a ver
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.56,0:00:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}com câncer de próstata?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando a gente pensa na próstata,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente tem que entender
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que a próstata,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ela engloba a uretra
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}É como se você tivesse
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}onde passa o xixi
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e ela vai fechando
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando ela vai crescendo,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.78,0:00:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ela vai fechando
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.54,0:00:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}esse buraco
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.76,0:00:21.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Então, existem alguns sintomas
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}de câncer de próstata
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que você precisa saber
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.66,0:00:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}E aí significa
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que isso aqui está fechando,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.80,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}esse buraquinho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.66,0:00:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}está fechando
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Mas, falando do seu rim,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente tem que entender
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que o câncer de próstata
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}pode ter efeitos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.02,0:00:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}no seu rim
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Uma das coisas
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.58,0:00:41.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que pode acontecer
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.66,0:00:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é que quando fecha
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}essa passagem de urina,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.18,0:00:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você pode fazer
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.12,0:00:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}uma obstrução da urina
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e fazer uma insuficiência renal
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.24,0:00:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hoje em dia,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}como a gente chama,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.48,0:00:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}uma injúria renal aguda
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Existem outros mecanismos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que podem provocar
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.98,0:00:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}problema renal,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.92,0:00:58.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}principalmente com o uso
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para o tratamento do câncer
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.06,0:01:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Por isso,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}procure um urologista
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e, se você tiver
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.00,0:01:05.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}problema renal,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.14,0:01:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}entre em contato
